        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"One Dance\", \"Views\", \"Do You Mind\"\n- People: Drake, DJ Maphorisa, Kyla, Themba Sekowe\n- Roles: Canadian rapper, South African record producer, disk jockey, singer\n\nFacts:\n- Themba Sekowe was born in 1988 and is popularly known by the stage name DJ Maphorisa.\n- DJ Maphorisa is a South African record producer and disk jockey who can sometimes feature vocals in songs.\n- Drake is a Canadian rapper.\n- \"Views\" is Drake's fourth studio album and was released in 2016.\n- \"One Dance\" is a song by Drake from his 2016 album \"Views\".\n- Kyla is best known for her song \"Do You Mind\".\n- \"Do You Mind\" became one of the most successful charting UK funky songs.\n- \"Do You Mind\" was later featured on Drake's 2016 international hit \"One Dance\".",
